  "details": "https://hello.vrchat.com/vrchat-plus-faq\n\nIn the \"What do I get for signing up with VRC+?\" section, there's some text about \"Currently, you get a few things for signing up for VRC+:\", but it doesn't mention +400 Favorite World Slots benefit for VRC+ subscribers added in [VRChat 2026.1.1](https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrchat-202611). Please add this benefit to the FAQ's list of VRC+ benefits.\n\nOddly enough, this benefit is listed on the main VRC+ advert page at https://hello.vrchat.com/vrchatplus but it's missing from the FAQ.\n\nRelated: https://feedback.vrchat.com/website/p/update-vrc-feature-page",
